      "message": "I guess the two questions that need to be answered are:\n- what does the kernel actually do when IFF_MULTICAST is set / not set?\n- what interfaces have IFF_POINTOPOINT set (as they will start supporting mDNS if IFF_MULTICAST is set and this patch is submitted).",
